Controlled-tier data are **not** publicly licensed. Access is granted only
under a signed Data Use Agreement with the SAHA Consortium. See
[docs/ACCESS_TIERS.md](docs/ACCESS_TIERS.md).

## Data Use Statement

All users are asked to observe the SAHA Data Use Statement (no re-identification
attempts, citation of the marker paper, research use only) in
[docs/ACCESS_TIERS.md](docs/ACCESS_TIERS.md#saha-data-use-statement). These are
community expectations, not additional license conditions — CC-BY 4.0 permits no
restrictions beyond attribution.
